  "Notes": "Mortar rebuilt 2026-09-24 (fun-builds/models/build_Mortar.py, primlib parts): chunky bronze siege mortar. Rig by name prefix: Base* static; Mount* yaws about the vertical axis through the origin (x = z = 0); Tube* pitches about the axis parallel to X through Pivot_PitchPivot (0, 3.85, 0.50) (trunnion centre). Built at 55 deg elevation pointing -Z and up, d = (0, sin55, -cos55); shells leave Pivot_MuzzleTip (0, 7.13, -1.79) = PitchPivot + 4.0 d, the centre of the muzzle face. Glow parts keep their group prefix: BaseGlowRim, MountGlowShell1..8, TubeGlowBore (orange neon). Mount + Tube stay within r 2.96 of the yaw axis for pitch 0..+8 (sandbags start at r 2.96, below the deck); the tube clears the carriage from -6 to +8 deg pitch about 55 (recoil is +6)."
